{"shortDescription":"Asia's diesel markets were mixed on Monday, with timespreads softening and margins remaining firm despite slower window spot activity, while jet fuel cash premiums fell to a one-year low.Window trades were scant, with markets awaiting the start of October refiner spot sales.The east-west price spre…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Asia's diesel markets were mixed on Monday, with timespreads softening and margins remaining firm despite slower window spot activity, while jet fuel cash premiums fell to a one-year low."]},{"type":"p","children":["Window trades were scant, with markets awaiting the start of October refiner spot sales."]},{"type":"p","children":["The east-west price spread widened back to discounts of around $175 per metric ton, reflecting the jump in ICE gasoil markets."]},{"type":"p","children":["Refining margins (GO10SGCKMc1) extended gains, rising to just over $71 a barrel."]},{"type":"p","children":["Cash differentials (GO10-SIN-DIF) inched down to $3.64 a barrel, in line with a softer swaps market structure despite a lack of window trading activity."]},{"type":"p","children":["For jet fuel, discussions were equally muted, though the east-west arbitrage spreads could remain supportive for the market in the near term."]},{"type":"p","children":["Northeast Asian exports to Europe could remain elevated through September, several trade sources say, with some shipping data showing exports from the region back at pre-war levels."]},{"type":"p","children":["Cash premiums for aviation fuel fell to the lowest in around a year, tracking lower offers on the trading window and slightly cautious trading sentiment amid expectations of rising supplies from Northeast Asia."]},{"type":"p","children":["Regrade (JETREG10SGMc1) continued to trade at discounts of around $2 a barrel."]},{"type":"p","children":["SINGAPORE CASH DEALS"]},{"type":"p","children":["- No deal for jet fuel or gasoil"]},{"type":"p","childr